1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,940
好了 親愛的 門鈴裝好了
Okay, honey, doorbell's installed.

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:04,450
-聽起來怎么樣 -歡迎來到地獄
- How's it sound? - Welcome to hell!

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:07,530
太可愛了
That is so cute!

4
00:00:08,334 --> 00:00:10,435
你能進來幫我弄一下這張網嗎
Can you come in here and help me with this web?

5
00:00:10,435 --> 00:00:12,507
抱歉 蒼蠅君得起飛了
Sorry, gotta fly.

6
00:00:12,527 --> 00:00:14,329
等人都來了我再說一次這蒼蠅起飛雙關梗
I'm gonna do that one again when there's more people around.

7
00:00:14,329 --> 00:00:16,600
好了 把那個掛到鉤子上
Okay. So, you got to put that up on the hook

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,049
因為不給糖就搗亂的孩子們隨時會來
because the trick-or-treaters are gonna be here any minute.

9
00:00:19,049 --> 00:00:20,195
我被纏住了
I'm caught.

10
00:00:20,195 --> 00:00:21,947
別硬拉 只會越來越...
Don't pull. It's just gonna get...

11
00:00:22,057 --> 00:00:23,034
糟
...worse.

12
00:00:23,222 --> 00:00:25,343
-不 我能... -別動了
- No, I can, uh -- - N- Stop moving.

13
00:00:25,343 --> 00:00:26,878
我去找把剪刀來
I'm gonna get some scissors.

14
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:31,790
杰瑞
Hey, Jerry.

15
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:33,510
出什么事了
What's wrong?

16
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,310
什么時候
When?

17
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:36,730
怎么會
How?

18
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:39,290
謝天謝地你回來了
Oh, thank God you're back.

19
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:41,210
這有只真蜘蛛 離我越來越近
There's a real spider in here, and it's getting closer.

20
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,630
是杰瑞的電話 我媽的老公
That was Jerry, my mom's husband.

21
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:44,750
一切還好嗎
Is everything okay?

22
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:45,810
不
No.

23
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:48,630
-我媽去世了 -什么
- My mom's dead. - What?

24
00:01:05,770 --> 00:01:07,590
真不敢相信外婆去世了
I can't believe Nana's gone.

25
00:01:08,630 --> 00:01:09,970
假如上帝真是個白人老頭
If God really is an old white guy,

26
00:01:10,644 --> 00:01:12,078
他會被外婆念叨死的
he's about to get an earful.

27
00:01:12,078 --> 00:01:13,394
我的天 克萊爾
Oh, my God, Claire.

28
00:01:13,622 --> 00:01:14,519
米奇爾
Mitchell.

29
00:01:16,450 --> 00:01:17,850
等等 你能不能
Wait, can you --

30
00:01:17,944 --> 00:01:18,910
-我覺得 -我不知道該怎么
- I think -- - I don't know how to --

31
00:01:18,910 --> 00:01:21,061
幫下忙 拜托你幫把手 謝謝
Yeah. Help. Please help. Thank you.

32
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:23,030
好了
All right.

33
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:27,410
你扮的這是誰
Who are you supposed to be?

34
00:01:28,111 --> 00:01:29,147
我是哈里王子
Ah, I'm Pr-I'm Prince Harry.

35
00:01:29,147 --> 00:01:30,820
這么說難道小卡他
Oh, does that mean Cam is --

36
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,842
都聽好了
Hear ye, hear ye,

37
00:01:33,050 --> 00:01:35,630
蘇塞克斯公爵夫人駕到 梅根...
presenting the Duchess of Sussex, Meghan --

38
00:01:36,048 --> 00:01:37,433
不不不 這些是為胡嬌的派對準備的
No, no, no, no, no. That was for Pepper's party.

39
00:01:37,433 --> 00:01:40,091
現在不說了 去安慰你的表親們吧
We're not doing that anymore. Go console your cousins.

40
00:01:40,270 --> 00:01:41,070
親愛的
Oh, sweetie.

41
00:01:42,033 --> 00:01:43,059
快來擁抱一下
Let me get in there.

42
00:01:43,059 --> 00:01:44,623
-等一下 -我們之前
- Oh, hang on. Oh -- - We were, um...

43
00:01:44,623 --> 00:01:45,997
-抬起來 -我剛才也遇到了這個問題
- All right, get up. - Yeah, this -- I had the same issue with this.

44
00:01:45,997 --> 00:01:47,122
你... 好了
Just -- Okay, there it is.

45
00:01:47,122 --> 00:01:48,646
親愛的
Oh, sweetie.

46
00:01:48,755 --> 00:01:49,642
誰想喝一杯
Who needs a drink?

47
00:01:49,642 --> 00:01:50,868
-我 -我
- I do. - I do.

48
00:01:51,210 --> 00:01:53,150
好吧 我們要怎么處理這難題
Okay, how are we gonna handle this?

49
00:01:53,390 --> 00:01:54,550
你是指因為地球上
You mean because the two most

50
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:56,130
感情最復雜的兩個人
emotionally complicated people on earth

51
00:01:56,130 --> 00:01:56,870
正在面對
are facing the loss

52
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:58,990
失去他們人生中最復雜的親密關系
of the most complicated relationship of their lives?

53
00:01:58,990 --> 00:02:01,030
這么說可食用的裝飾品不能管用
So... not an edible arrangement.

54
00:02:01,830 --> 00:02:03,090
我們只要陪著他們就好
We just have to be there for them.

55
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,990
無論他們需要什么 我
Whatever they need. I --

56
00:02:04,990 --> 00:02:06,350
我只是覺得穿成這樣
It just feels inappropriate

57
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,950
-太不合時宜了 -是啊
- being dressed like this. - Yeah.

58
00:02:07,950 --> 00:02:09,950
我該穿件深色沉肩袖的裙子
I should be in something darker with a cap sleeve.

59
00:02:12,775 --> 00:02:14,866
太不真實了 我無法相信
This is so surreal. I-I can't believe this.

60
00:02:14,866 --> 00:02:17,177
在她離世前我才和她通過話
I-I just talked to her right before she left.

61
00:02:17,177 --> 00:02:18,930
要和女性互助組織去格陵蘭旅行
She was so excited about her trip to Greenland

62
00:02:18,930 --> 00:02:20,035
她是那么興奮
with her women's group.

63
00:02:20,035 --> 00:02:21,429
還是不知道她是怎么走的嗎
Still no word on what happened?

64
00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:22,770
不知道 杰瑞來電話了
No. Jerry called.

65
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:24,470
他說她心臟有問題
He said that she had a heart problem

66
00:02:24,470 --> 00:02:25,350
但她不想告訴別人
she didn't want to talk about,

67
00:02:25,350 --> 00:02:26,610
但是還不知道是不是因為這個
but we're still not sure if that's it.

68
00:02:26,610 --> 00:02:29,450
他保證一有答案就聯系我們
He did promise to reach out as soon as he has some answers.

69
00:02:29,505 --> 00:02:31,557
我們會盡一切所能支持你們
Well, we're here to support you in any way we can.

70
00:02:31,557 --> 00:02:34,276
是啊 無論你們需要什么都交給我們
Yeah. Anything you need, anything at all, we're on it.

71
00:02:34,510 --> 00:02:35,650
湯 紙巾
Soup? Tissues?

72
00:02:36,510 --> 00:02:38,110
試試這個冥想練習
Try this meditation exercise.

73
00:02:38,119 --> 00:02:41,894
不 你們真的很貼心 我只想...
Yeah, no, you guys are being so sweet. I just --

74
00:02:41,894 --> 00:02:43,646
是啊 我們應對悲痛時
Yeah, but w-we cope with things

75
00:02:43,670 --> 00:02:45,010
沒有那么多愁善感
a little less touchy-feely

76
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:45,810
更傾向于
and a little more --

77
00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:48,110
-愛爾蘭風格 -沒錯 沒錯
- Irish. Yes. - Right. Right.

78
00:02:48,410 --> 00:02:50,690
喝些酒 講些趣事
You know, have some drinks, tell some funny stories.

79
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:53,330
記不記得那次媽媽氣瘋了
Do you remember the time Mom was so mad

80
00:02:53,330 --> 00:02:55,430
因為拉文與雪莉[情景劇角色]搬去了加州
because "Laverne and Shirley" moved to California?

81
00:02:56,652 --> 00:02:58,495
還有 記不記得她過去
Or, no, remember how she used to always

82
00:02:58,495 --> 00:03:00,128
去餐廳時總自帶冰塊
bring her own ice cubes to restaurants?

83
00:03:00,128 --> 00:03:01,512
天啊 沒錯
Oh, God, yes!

84
00:03:01,670 --> 00:03:03,750
記不記得她被趕出山達基教[邪教]那次
Remember when she got thrown out of Scientology?

85
00:03:06,890 --> 00:03:08,710
我們的母親去世了 菲爾
Our mother is dead, Phil.

86
00:03:08,742 --> 00:03:09,927
我以為我們在...
I-I thought we were --

87
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:11,950
或許你們該給我們些空間
Maybe you should just give us a little space?

88
00:03:11,958 --> 00:03:13,034
-好的 好的 -當然 好的
- Yeah. Yeah, sure. - Of course. Yes.

89
00:03:13,610 --> 00:03:14,190
-好的 -好的
- Sure. - Sure.

90
00:03:14,249 --> 00:03:16,430
我不知道大家都對死后的世界有何想法
You know, I don't know how we all feel about the afterlife,

91
00:03:16,430 --> 00:03:18,790
但我愿意想象迪迪
but I myself would like to imagine Dede

92
00:03:19,050 --> 00:03:20,530
被親人們圍繞 聽到...
surrounded by loved ones, hearing --

93
00:03:21,410 --> 00:03:22,410
歡迎來到地獄
Welcome to hell!

94
00:03:23,082 --> 00:03:24,297
我去關掉門鈴
I'll disconnect that doorbell.

95
00:03:24,297 --> 00:03:25,234
老天
Oh, God.

96
00:03:27,862 --> 00:03:29,814
我們本來在外面討糖果
We were out trick-or-treating with the kids.

97
00:03:29,814 --> 00:03:31,158
-爸爸 -我們把喬留給曼尼照看
- Dad. - We left Joe with Manny,

98
00:03:31,158 --> 00:03:32,602
一聽到消息就趕來了
and we came as soon as we heard.

99
00:03:32,602 --> 00:03:33,698
我很遺憾
So sorry.

100
00:03:33,698 --> 00:03:35,580
-你們倆過來 抱抱 -謝謝 爸爸
- Come here, you two. Get in here. - Oh, thanks, Dad.

101
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:37,402
我知道 等我... 好了
Yeah. I know. You just have to -- Yeah.

102
00:03:37,690 --> 00:03:41,130
我知道你們母親和我以前有過分歧
Look, I know that your mother and I had our differences,

103
00:03:41,210 --> 00:03:42,610
但她是個好女人
but she was a good woman.

104
00:03:42,730 --> 00:03:43,170
嗯
Yeah.

105
00:03:43,278 --> 00:03:44,374
她...
She, uh...

106
00:03:45,917 --> 00:03:48,277
她有一雙美腿
Yeah, she had great legs.

107
00:03:48,277 --> 00:03:49,552
你不是吧 只想得出這句悼念詞嗎
Oh. Really? That's your tribute?

108
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:51,890
當然不是 她很有教養
Of course not. She was very educated,

109
00:03:51,890 --> 00:03:52,990
她自己常這么說
as she often told me.

110
00:03:53,167 --> 00:03:54,373
她...
She, um...uh...

111
00:03:56,084 --> 00:03:57,071
她
She --

112
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:58,375
我看不下去了
I can't watch this.

113
00:03:58,375 --> 00:04:00,745
簡直像看著一條魚在船底掙扎求生
It's like watching a fish panic at the bottom of a boat.

114
00:04:00,745 --> 00:04:03,344
她給予了你我們 你兩個優秀的孩子
Uh, she -- she gave you us, your wonderful children.

115
00:04:03,344 --> 00:04:06,451
對的 為此我永遠心懷感激
There you go. And for that I will always be grateful.

116
00:04:06,451 --> 00:04:09,658
是的 我們有很多需要感恩的事
Yeah. We have so much to be grateful for.

117
00:04:09,658 --> 00:04:11,749
她是個很棒的母親
She was a wonderful mother.

118
00:04:11,749 --> 00:04:14,269
我很慶幸在最后一次跟她打電話時
And I'm -- I am so glad that I was able to tell her that

119
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:15,770
告訴她了
during our last call.

120
00:04:15,770 --> 00:04:17,110
我當時沒想到
And I didn't know it at the time,

121
00:04:17,130 --> 00:04:20,890
但從很多方面來說 那都是最完美的道別
but in a lot of ways, it was the perfect goodbye.

122
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,835
知道她去世的原因嗎
Do we know what happened?

123
00:04:24,835 --> 00:04:27,145
還不知道 不過
Not yet, no. But you know what?

124
00:04:27,145 --> 00:04:30,332
-我想被開心的事物圍繞 -對
- I need to be around happy things... - Yeah.

125
00:04:30,332 --> 00:04:32,752
比如盛裝來討糖果的可愛孩子們
...cute kids in costumes trick-or-treating.

126
00:04:32,752 --> 00:04:34,365
我要去給他們發萬圣節糖果
I'm gonna go hand out some Halloween candy.

127
00:04:34,365 --> 00:04:36,317
-我沒事 我沒事 -我跟你一起去
- I'm good! Good, good! - I'm -- I'm coming with you.

128
00:04:36,376 --> 00:04:37,880
-我沒事 -我們沒事
- I'm good. - We're good.

129
00:04:39,493 --> 00:04:40,509
人做好了計劃
Ah, you make plans,

130
00:04:40,509 --> 00:04:42,581
卻被老天爺打亂
the universe steps in and says "Nope."

131
00:04:42,770 --> 00:04:44,781
-人生真不公平 -說得對
- Life is so unfair. - Damn right.

132
00:04:45,410 --> 00:04:47,570
我剛剛在街角排隊
I just waited in a line around the block

133
00:04:47,570 --> 00:04:49,510
買到網紅特大號三明治
for a hoagie everybody's talking about.

134
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:51,470
就突然得知我前妻死了
Then my ex-wife drops dead,

135
00:04:51,470 --> 00:04:52,910
現在我很難過 吃不下了
and I'm too sad to eat it.

136
00:04:54,170 --> 00:04:55,450
過一小時再吃好了
I'll give it another hour.

137
00:04:55,890 --> 00:04:58,930
你還真"慘"啊 杰
Oh, I'm so sorry for your loss, Jay.

138
00:05:00,690 --> 00:05:02,830
我不知道為什么覺得拿這個出來會有幫助
I don't know why I thought getting this out would help.

139
00:05:03,310 --> 00:05:04,150
那是什么
What is that?

140
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:06,780
外婆找人做了一些自己的小人偶
Nana had these little statues of herself made.

141
00:05:07,019 --> 00:05:08,931
圣誕節時送給了我們當禮物
They were her Christmas gift to each of us.

142
00:05:08,931 --> 00:05:11,859
我覺得她用我名義在非洲挖的井沒那么傻了
Now I feel better about my stupid well in Africa.

143
00:05:11,859 --> 00:05:14,239
你糖吃得很兇啊
Hey. Hitting that candy pretty hard.

144
00:05:14,239 --> 00:05:16,101
上一根棒棒糖你連糖紙一起吞了
You didn't even take the wrapper off the last one.

145
00:05:16,101 --> 00:05:17,525
我很難過 閉嘴
I'm sad. Shut up.

146
00:05:17,615 --> 00:05:19,497
我聽說在萬圣節那天死的人
I heard that if you die on Halloween,

147
00:05:19,497 --> 00:05:21,279
會變成喪尸復活
you come back as a zombie.

148
00:05:21,528 --> 00:05:22,674
我能想象得出來
I can see that.

149
00:05:22,773 --> 00:05:24,038
外婆猙獰嘶吼
Nana would be all,

150
00:05:24,107 --> 00:05:25,980
"我要吃腦
"Braaainnssss!

151
00:05:26,786 --> 00:05:28,579
這個沒腦 我要吃腦"
Nope. Braaainnsss!"

152
00:05:31,447 --> 00:05:32,771
我記得外婆
I just remember Nana --

153
00:05:32,771 --> 00:05:34,673
我們小的時候 她會...
when we were little, she would --

154
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:36,527
她會...
She would --

155
00:05:36,556 --> 00:05:38,071
老天 你們倆是什么奇葩啊
Oh, my God! What is wrong with you two?!

156
00:05:38,071 --> 00:05:40,907
-干嘛 -我們外婆剛剛去世了
- What? - Our grandmother just died.

157
00:05:40,907 --> 00:05:42,660
盧克在開些沒品的笑話
Luke's over here making tasteless jokes,

158
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:44,253
而你像豬一樣猛吃
and you're stuffing your face.

159
00:05:44,253 --> 00:05:45,828
能不能尊重一下她
Show some respect!

160
00:05:45,946 --> 00:05:49,282
你們外婆去世了 我很遺憾
I am so sorry, what happened to your grandmother.

161
00:05:49,282 --> 00:05:51,095
她是個很棒的女人
She was a wonderful woman.

162
00:05:51,095 --> 00:05:52,599
謝謝你 歌洛莉亞
Thank you, Gloria.

163
00:05:52,599 --> 00:05:55,377
終于有人有點正常反應了
Finally, someone with a normal reaction.

164
00:05:55,377 --> 00:05:57,389
外婆不是曾經三次試圖勒死你嗎
Didn't Nana try to strangle you three times?

165
00:05:57,389 --> 00:05:59,301
是 但其中一次
Yeah, but one of those times,

166
00:05:59,301 --> 00:06:01,770
我瀕死時有一剎那再次看到了我
I was able to see again my favorite abuela

167
00:06:01,770 --> 00:06:02,906
最愛的祖母
for one second.

168
00:06:02,906 --> 00:06:05,674
所以我真該感謝迪迪
So I really should thank Dede.

169
00:06:05,674 --> 00:06:09,319
總之 我和你們外婆之間的矛盾
Anyways, any issues that your grandmother had with me,

170
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,594
都過去了
they're behind her.

171
00:06:10,594 --> 00:06:13,521
她現在得到了安寧 去了一個更好的地方
She's at peace. She's living in a better place.

172
00:06:13,521 --> 00:06:15,095
那他媽是什么鬼
What the hell is that?!

173
00:06:15,095 --> 00:06:17,535
很逼真吧 外婆送的圣誕禮物
Mm. Pretty lifelike, right? Christmas gift from Nana.

174
00:06:17,535 --> 00:06:19,307
是嗎 很可愛
Ah, it's very cute.

175
00:06:19,307 --> 00:06:22,604
不過真不可思議 我走到哪
But it's amazing how her eyes are --

176
00:06:22,783 --> 00:06:25,163
她眼睛都盯著我
are following me wherever I go!

177
00:06:25,292 --> 00:06:26,936
我知道這話聽起來挺瘋的
I know that this is going to sound crazy,

178
00:06:26,936 --> 00:06:29,933
不過我一直擔心迪迪死后
but I have always worried that when Dede died,

179
00:06:30,890 --> 00:06:33,430
會化成厲鬼回來纏著我
she was going to come back and haunt me.

180
00:06:33,850 --> 00:06:36,290
可能是因為我結婚時 她在我耳邊這么說過
Maybe it's because she whispered it to me at my wedding.

181
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:38,110
萬圣節快樂
Happy Halloween.

182
00:06:41,970 --> 00:06:42,570
真可愛
Cute.

183
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:44,150
你還好嗎
You okay?

184
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:45,830
還好啦 我就是在想
Yeah, I was just thinking about

185
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:47,490
跟媽媽度過的一次超贊萬圣節
this great Halloween with Mom.

186
00:06:48,217 --> 00:06:50,398
我在高中的時候融入不進大家
I wasn't really fitting in in high school,

187
00:06:50,398 --> 00:06:53,116
所以媽媽帶我去了
so Mom took me to go get ice cream

188
00:06:53,116 --> 00:06:55,496
在西好萊塢區的一家冰激凌店
at this place in West Hollywood.

189
00:06:55,586 --> 00:06:57,060
而當時那里有同性戀游行
And the parade was going on.

190
00:06:57,060 --> 00:07:00,057
在那之前 我從沒去過任何同性戀活動
And before that, I had never been to a gay event.

191
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:01,790
不給糖就搗蛋
Trick or treat!

192
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:04,051
給你 萬圣節快樂
Here you go. Happy Halloween.

193
00:07:04,579 --> 00:07:05,555
我的重點是
The thing is,

194
00:07:05,644 --> 00:07:07,586
她并沒有逼我談同性戀的事
she didn't force me to talk about it.

195
00:07:07,586 --> 00:07:09,110
她就順其自然 你懂嗎
She just let it be. You know?

196
00:07:09,110 --> 00:07:10,882
我想那大概就是她在告訴我
And I-I think that that was her way of saying

197
00:07:12,110 --> 00:07:13,670
她可以接受我性向
that she was okay with me.

198
00:07:14,150 --> 00:07:15,550
我還記得媽媽曾對我說
I remember once Mom told me

199
00:07:15,550 --> 00:07:17,630
我吃冰激凌的方式像個妓女
that I ate ice cream like a prostitute.

200
00:07:18,202 --> 00:07:18,926
靠
Ugghh, come on.

201
00:07:18,967 --> 00:07:20,144
為什么等到現在
Wh-Why haven't we heard anything yet

202
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,370
都還不知道她到底怎么去世的
about what happened to her?

203
00:07:22,550 --> 00:07:23,470
也太扯了吧
This is ridiculous!

204
00:07:23,810 --> 00:07:25,750
對啊 失去母親已經夠殘酷了
I know. It's bad enough we lost our mom.

205
00:07:25,810 --> 00:07:28,330
我們現在還得在這自己亂瞎猜
Now we just have to sit here expecting the worst.

206
00:07:28,758 --> 00:07:30,202
好像聽到有一些吼聲
Uh, heard some raised voices,

207
00:07:30,202 --> 00:07:31,367
-就來確定... -你們倆都去哪了
- just making... - Where have you guys been?

208
00:07:31,367 --> 00:07:32,313
不知道你們倆有沒注意到
Yeah, I don't know if you've noticed,

209
00:07:32,313 --> 00:07:33,637
但我們今天正在為一些事情難過
but we're kind of going through something today.

210
00:07:33,637 --> 00:07:35,559
是你們說想要一點私人空間
Well, you s-said you wanted some space,

211
00:07:35,559 --> 00:07:37,471
-所以我們給你們... -開始跟我們擺道理了嗎
- so we were giving you... - So now you're gonna logic us to death?

212
00:07:37,471 --> 00:07:39,802
真棒啊 我們現在就想聽人說我們無理取鬧
Yeah, yeah, 'cause that's what we need right now.

213
00:07:43,110 --> 00:07:45,070
我完全迷糊了
I am totally confused

214
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:47,290
-不知道該怎么處理他倆 -我有個主意
- about what we're supposed to do. - No. I have an idea.

215
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:49,910
米奇爾剛剛才說到跟媽媽那段
Mitchell was just talking about a great memory he had

216
00:07:50,646 --> 00:07:53,236
去西好萊塢吃冰激凌的美好回憶
of Dede taking him for ice cream in West Hollywood.

217
00:07:53,236 --> 00:07:56,293
我們可以去幫他買 這算是完美的致意了
We could go pick some up -- it would be a perfect tribute.

218
00:07:56,293 --> 00:07:57,787
好棒啊
That's great.

219
00:07:57,787 --> 00:07:59,938
而且 我不知為何 就...
Plus, I don't know why, but there's --

220
00:07:59,978 --> 00:08:02,348
就覺得克萊爾吃冰激凌的方式
there's something about the way Claire eats ice cream

221
00:08:02,348 --> 00:08:04,618
讓我感到十分... 享受
that I just...enjoy.

222
00:08:04,618 --> 00:08:06,132
真希望我還記得那家店叫什么名字
I just wish I could remember the name of it.

223
00:08:06,132 --> 00:08:07,905
-我在查 安德森·一勺珀 -不是
- I'm on it. Anderson Scooper? - No.

224
00:08:07,905 --> 00:08:09,539
沙漠妖"基"冰激凌
Priscilla Queen of the Desserts?

225
00:08:09,707 --> 00:08:11,251
"冰"特與恩尼
Mnh-mnh. Sherbert and Ernie?

226
00:08:11,251 --> 00:08:12,804
我記得名字是很具體的
Mnh-mnh. It was something very specific.

227
00:08:12,804 --> 00:08:14,895
西好萊塢冰激凌店嗎
West Hollywood Ice Cream Shop?

228
00:08:14,895 --> 00:08:17,166
-就是這家 走吧 -這不是真的吧
- That's it. Let's go. - This can't be happening.

229
00:08:18,271 --> 00:08:19,974
杰 我明白你很難接受
Ohh. Aw, Jay, it's a hard day.

230
00:08:19,974 --> 00:08:20,802
你們說說
Tell me.

231
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:23,270
我在冰箱里放了一個寫我名字的三明治
I put a sandwich in there with my name on it

232
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:25,053
才放了10分鐘 現在就不見了
10 minutes ago, and now it's missing.

233
00:08:25,063 --> 00:08:27,483
-誰他媽吃了 -不是吧 今天這種日子
- Who the hell took it?! - Really? On a day like today,

234
00:08:27,483 --> 00:08:30,192
你居然要為一個三明治火冒三丈嗎
you can get this worked up over a sandwich?

235
00:08:30,350 --> 00:08:32,450
-過來 -沒事的
- Come here. - Hey. It's okay.

236
00:08:33,730 --> 00:08:35,190
你在聞我們的味道
You're smelling us.

237
00:08:35,210 --> 00:08:36,850
我聞到了愧疚與腌黃瓜味
I smell guilt and pickles.

238
00:08:39,850 --> 00:08:41,190
抱歉 消防員的習慣
Sorry, fireman habit.

239
00:08:41,350 --> 00:08:42,530
你媽媽說你在樓上待著
Your mom said you were up here.

240
00:08:43,456 --> 00:08:44,812
你真是最好的男朋友了
You're the best boyfriend.

241
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:46,250
這是你外婆吧
That's her, huh?

242
00:08:47,011 --> 00:08:47,819
是的
Yep.

243
00:08:48,157 --> 00:08:49,461
很多人說她很難相處
People said she was difficult,

244
00:08:49,461 --> 00:08:51,224
但她真的是個很棒的女人
but she was an amazing woman

245
00:08:51,224 --> 00:08:53,036
從來不讓別人的話
who didn't conform to anyone's idea

246
00:08:53,036 --> 00:08:54,332
影響自己追求本心
of who she should be.

247
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:57,259
有好多她被人趕出場的照片啊
There are a lot of photos of her being escorted out of places.

248
00:08:57,777 --> 00:08:58,634
是啊
Yeah.

249
00:08:59,610 --> 00:09:02,150
也算好事吧 能知道她...
Well, it must feel good to know that --

250
00:09:02,210 --> 00:09:05,570
我不是指真的好事 這事情很糟糕
I mean not good. Everything must feel bad.

251
00:09:05,570 --> 00:09:07,990
對不起 我不太會面對死亡這件事
I'm sorry. I'm bad at this whole death thing.

252
00:09:07,990 --> 00:09:09,830
盡管我在工作中會常常面對死亡
And I see a lot of it at work.

253
00:09:09,970 --> 00:09:12,990
真的 大家每次都不去喂隊寵小金魚
I mean, nobody ever feeds the station goldfish.

254
00:09:13,230 --> 00:09:14,730
不只是你覺得難以面對
It's not just hard for you.

255
00:09:15,290 --> 00:09:17,490
我弟弟一直瘋狂在開冷笑話
My brother can't stop cracking jokes,

256
00:09:18,341 --> 00:09:21,498
我姐姐像要冬眠前的熊一樣在瘋狂大吃
my sister's eating like a bear about to hibernate,

257
00:09:21,498 --> 00:09:24,704
而與此同時 我只能坐在這想著
and meanwhile, I'm just sitting here thinking,

258
00:09:24,784 --> 00:09:28,757
"世事無常 前一秒人還在 一轉眼就...
"Wow, you're here one second, and then poof...

259
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:29,630
就不在了"
you're not."

260
00:09:32,450 --> 00:09:35,570
我知道你有多難過
I know how sad you must be.

261
00:09:36,610 --> 00:09:37,290
脫了你的上衣
Take off your shirt.

262
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:38,590
-什么 -算了
- What? -Fine.

263
00:09:39,094 --> 00:09:40,927
老娘來指揮
I'll run things.

264
00:09:45,810 --> 00:09:47,470
行行行 很好笑
Okay, very funny!

265
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:48,810
這是誰干的
Who did this?!

266
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:56,860
圣母瑪利亞 為我們罪人所祈禱
Santa Maria, Madre de Dios, ruega por nosotros pecadores.

267
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:58,772
圣母瑪利亞 為我們罪人所祈禱
Santa Maria, Madre de Dios, ruega por nosotros pecadores.

268
00:09:58,772 --> 00:10:00,555
在這個有人去世的...
ahora y en la hora -- Aah!

269
00:10:01,849 --> 00:10:03,921
圣母瑪利亞 為我們罪人所祈禱
Santa Maria, Madre de Dios, ruega por nosotros pecadores.

270
00:10:03,921 --> 00:10:05,863
在這個有人去世的時刻 阿門
ahora y en la hora de nuestra muerte. Amen.

271
00:10:08,731 --> 00:10:10,952
艾麗克斯吼我們之后我就沒看見過她了
Hey, I haven't seen Alex since she yelled at us.

272
00:10:10,952 --> 00:10:12,017
她在樓上還好吧
Is she okay up there?

273
00:10:12,017 --> 00:10:13,541
聽你這么一說
Now that I think about it,

274
00:10:13,541 --> 00:10:15,742
我好像剛才有聽到類似她在哭的聲音
it did sound like she was crying a minute ago.

275
00:10:15,742 --> 00:10:19,227
我們應該去看看她 她每次都這樣
We should check on her. This is classic Alex.

276
00:10:19,227 --> 00:10:21,647
她指責我們對待外婆去世的方式有問題
She's criticizing how we're processing Nana's death

277
00:10:21,647 --> 00:10:23,997
因為她不知道怎么處理她自己的感情
because she doesn't know what to do with her own feelings.

278
00:10:24,027 --> 00:10:26,676
而且其實她比任何人都看得重
Meanwhile, she's taking it harder than anybody.

279
00:10:27,244 --> 00:10:28,718
-出去 -慘了
-Get out! - Oh, that's not good.

280
00:10:32,950 --> 00:10:34,245
你記得小時候
Do you remember when, um,

281
00:10:34,493 --> 00:10:36,276
她不肯出我的聲樂課學費
she wouldn't pay for my voice lessons

282
00:10:36,276 --> 00:10:38,148
因為她想把那錢省下來
because she said she wanted to save the money

283
00:10:38,148 --> 00:10:39,911
以防我最后長了和爸爸一樣的鼻子
in case I ended up with Dad's nose?

284
00:10:39,911 --> 00:10:42,649
我們今天可以一直說好故事的
You know, we -- we could stick to nice stories today.

285
00:10:42,930 --> 00:10:45,450
媽媽是個真實的人 她也有缺點的
Mom was a real person. She was flawed.

286
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:48,350
她讓我穿褲子去畢業舞會
She made me wear pants to prom.

287
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:50,170
她說這樣
She said it would "slow down"

288
00:10:50,170 --> 00:10:51,970
我不管要"犯什么錯"都能拖慢速度
whatever mistake I was about to make.

289
00:10:52,210 --> 00:10:54,150
可能我從來不會引出她的那一面
Well, I guess I never brought out that side of her.

290
00:10:54,150 --> 00:10:57,430
也可能是你總是什么都不跟她計較
Or maybe you just let her get away with everything.

291
00:10:57,587 --> 00:10:58,971
-我 -不給糖就搗蛋
- I -- - Trick or treat!

292
00:10:58,971 --> 00:11:00,216
萬圣節快樂
Happy Halloween!

293
00:11:00,694 --> 00:11:02,108
你 你扮的是誰啊
What are you -- What are you supposed to be?

294
00:11:02,108 --> 00:11:04,269
我本來想裝扮成獨角獸
I was gonna go as a unicorn...

295
00:11:04,269 --> 00:11:07,247
但后來我決定扮成穿睡衣的女孩
...but then I decided to be pajama girl.

296
00:11:07,330 --> 00:11:08,990
縫了兩周白縫了
That was two weeks of sewing well spent.

297
00:11:09,250 --> 00:11:10,530
小孩子總是不了解
Well, kids don't always appreciate

298
00:11:10,530 --> 00:11:11,630
媽媽的苦心
what moms do for them.

299
00:11:11,970 --> 00:11:12,810
媽媽可能控制欲太強了
Moms can be controlling.

300
00:11:12,950 --> 00:11:14,010
有時媽媽不想
Well, sometimes moms don't want

301
00:11:14,010 --> 00:11:15,210
被自己女兒丟人現眼
their daughters to embarrass themselves.

302
00:11:16,290 --> 00:11:16,310
丟臉
Embarrass?

303
00:11:16,850 --> 00:11:19,250
就好比給女兒第一次例假
Like throwing a surprise moon goddess party

304
00:11:19,250 --> 00:11:21,070
舉辦一個驚喜的月亮女神聚會嗎
for their daughter's first period?

305
00:11:21,110 --> 00:11:23,250
那是為了慶祝你開始成長為女人
It was a celebration of your womanhood!

306
00:11:23,310 --> 00:11:25,720
每年我都說不要來這家
Every year I say I'm not coming back to this house.

307
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,224
好吧 就今天 天啊
Okay. Just today -- Oh, God.

308
00:11:27,224 --> 00:11:29,743
就 就今天 能不能
Just -- Just today, could you not harp

309
00:11:29,890 --> 00:11:32,530
不要嘮叨媽媽對你有多不好
on how awful Mom was to you?

310
00:11:32,610 --> 00:11:34,390
她是愿意為我們做出任何犧牲的人
She would have done anything for us!

311
00:11:34,930 --> 00:11:37,350
米奇爾 媽媽去世了
Mitchell, just because Mom is dead

312
00:11:37,350 --> 00:11:38,890
并不代表她就是圣人
doesn't make her a saint!

313
00:11:40,030 --> 00:11:40,330
什么
What?

314
00:11:41,110 --> 00:11:42,310
你嚇到孩子了
You're scaring the kids.

315
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,815
我有什么問題啊
Ugh. What is wrong with me?

316
00:11:50,815 --> 00:11:52,310
你沒問題
Nothing is wrong with you.

317
00:11:52,369 --> 00:11:54,729
你只是個因為悲劇而產生性欲的怪胎
You're just a freak that gets turned on by tragedies.

318
00:11:54,729 --> 00:11:57,378
天啊 這就是我和消防員交往的原因嗎
Oh, my God. Is that why I'm dating a firefighter?

319
00:11:57,378 --> 00:11:59,340
寶貝 我希望我對你來說不止如此
Oh, I hope I'm more to you than that, babe.

320
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:01,740
順便說下 塔斯廷發生了一起墜機事件
By the way, there was a plane crash in Tustin.

321
00:12:04,070 --> 00:12:06,589
性和死亡之間
You know, there's a deep psycho-spiritual connection

322
00:12:06,589 --> 00:12:07,834
有非常深的心靈聯系
between sex and death.

323
00:12:07,834 --> 00:12:09,378
看看弗洛伊德 死神塔納托斯和愛神厄洛斯
Look at Freud. Thanatos, Eros --

324
00:12:09,378 --> 00:12:11,012
困在永久的掙扎中
locked in an eternal struggle.

325
00:12:11,340 --> 00:12:12,953
你怎么知道這些詞匯的
How do you know any of those words?

326
00:12:12,953 --> 00:12:13,829
我不知道
I don't know.

327
00:12:13,829 --> 00:12:15,452
可能我莫名其妙記住了學校學的東西吧
Maybe I remembered something from school somehow.

328
00:12:15,572 --> 00:12:17,384
有人說你聽到過的所有東西
They say everything you've ever heard

329
00:12:17,384 --> 00:12:19,077
都存在你大腦里的某處
is locked in your brain somewhere.

330
00:12:19,107 --> 00:12:20,203
還有個有趣的事實
Another fun fact --

331
00:12:20,203 --> 00:12:23,549
你所攝入的卡路里 有20%會被大腦消耗掉
your brain burns 20% of the calories you consume.

332
00:12:23,698 --> 00:12:24,814
我的玉米煎餅
My burrito!

333
00:12:24,913 --> 00:12:25,980
又吃一個嗎
Another one?

334
00:12:26,905 --> 00:12:27,872
天啊
Oh, my God.

335
00:12:28,219 --> 00:12:29,912
我想你的大腦終于運轉了
I think your brain is finally working

336
00:12:29,912 --> 00:12:31,476
因為有史以來你第一次
because, for the first time ever,

337
00:12:31,525 --> 00:12:33,099
沒有餓著自己了
you're not starving yourself.

338
00:12:33,099 --> 00:12:35,011
這是個可靠的假設
That is a credible hypothesis.

339
00:12:36,266 --> 00:12:37,530
吃東西呢
Huh. Eating, are we? Mm.

340
00:12:38,018 --> 00:12:40,130
你們沒有剛好把一個意大利英雄三明治
You didn't happen to grab an Italian hero

341
00:12:40,130 --> 00:12:41,394
給拿出冰箱吧
out of the fridge, did you?

342
00:12:41,394 --> 00:12:43,057
沒 但聽起來很好吃的樣子
Nope, but that sounds delicious.

343
00:12:43,057 --> 00:12:45,079
我愿意現在去生吞一個"意大利英雄"
I'd go to town on an Italian hero right now.

344
00:12:45,079 --> 00:12:46,732
有意思 因為艾麗克斯剛"生吞"了...
That's funny, 'cause Alex just finished --

345
00:12:46,732 --> 00:12:48,863
我會把你的舌頭扯掉
I will rip your tongue out.

346
00:12:48,983 --> 00:12:50,686
天啊
Oh, my gosh.

347
00:12:51,054 --> 00:12:52,757
我想什么呢 在萬圣節的晚上
What was I thinking coming to West Hollywood

348
00:12:52,757 --> 00:12:54,300
來西好萊塢
on Halloween night?

349
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:56,190
別按喇叭了 有游行經過
Give the horn a rest. The parade's going by.

350
00:12:57,169 --> 00:12:58,254
你們得在這兒待一會兒了
You're gonna be sitting here a while.

351
00:12:58,254 --> 00:12:59,350
對不起 警官
Sorry, Officer.

352
00:13:01,850 --> 00:13:04,170
我不常到這塊兒
I don't get down to this part of town that often.

353
00:13:05,066 --> 00:13:06,530
但那 那不是個真警察 對吧
That's -- That's not a real cop, right?

354
00:13:06,530 --> 00:13:08,242
不是
Uh...mm, no.

355
00:13:08,900 --> 00:13:10,483
真佩服你還穿著那件裙子
You know, I'm impressed you're still wearing that dress.

356
00:13:10,483 --> 00:13:12,226
我穿著兩條塑身褲
Oh, well, I'm wearing two pair of Spanx

357
00:13:12,226 --> 00:13:14,257
為了不尿尿 提前48小時開始服用利尿劑
and was on a diuretic for 48 hours.

358
00:13:14,257 --> 00:13:15,373
在我出生的地方 我們說
As we say where I'm from,

359
00:13:15,373 --> 00:13:17,046
你不會教你的狗彈班卓琴
you don't teach your dog to play the banjo

360
00:13:17,046 --> 00:13:19,137
然后不去參加才藝表演
and then skip the talent show.

361
00:13:20,010 --> 00:13:21,090
天啊
Oh, man.

362
00:13:22,453 --> 00:13:24,116
冰淇淋要化了
This ice cream is gonna melt.

363
00:13:24,903 --> 00:13:27,243
拿起勺子吧
Well, grab a spoon.

364
00:13:28,827 --> 00:13:30,639
-總得有人來吃 -沒錯
- Somebody should enjoy it. - Yeah.

365
00:13:36,883 --> 00:13:39,084
我們太關注在米奇爾和克萊爾身上了
You know, we've been so focused on Mitchell and Claire,

366
00:13:39,831 --> 00:13:41,902
我都沒有機會真正緬懷...
I haven't had a chance to really...

367
00:13:42,070 --> 00:13:43,750
對
Yeah. I know.

368
00:13:44,110 --> 00:13:45,730
我第一次見她 她威脅我說
First time I met her, she threatened to murder me

369
00:13:45,730 --> 00:13:47,350
要是我敢惹他兒子不開心就殺了我
if I ever made her son unhappy.

370
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,850
而且還說得十分詳細
Went into pretty graphic detail --

371
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:52,710
描述了她要怎么處理掉我的尸體之類的
described how she'd get rid of my body and everything.

372
00:13:53,210 --> 00:13:53,990
我的反應是
I was like, "Wow,

373
00:13:53,990 --> 00:13:56,110
"這個女人永遠都不會信任我的"
this woman will never trust me."

374
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:57,310
這太有她的風格了
That's so her.

375
00:13:59,877 --> 00:14:01,212
還有一次 她不小心聽到我談起
Then one time, she overheard me talking

376
00:14:01,212 --> 00:14:05,723
我和我奶奶喝蒲公英酒
about drinking dandelion wine with my -- with my grandma.

377
00:14:05,723 --> 00:14:07,416
她直接走到櫥柜那
She went over to the kitchen cabinet

378
00:14:07,416 --> 00:14:08,690
拿出了一瓶
and pulled out a bottle.

379
00:14:08,690 --> 00:14:09,696
原來她有一個阿姨
Apparently, she had an aunt

380
00:14:09,696 --> 00:14:11,032
教會了她怎么釀這種酒
that taught her how to make it.

381
00:14:11,369 --> 00:14:13,829
我們就坐在廚房的桌子旁
And we sat there at the kitchen table

382
00:14:13,829 --> 00:14:16,040
喝著小酒 互相講述著
drinking and swapping stories

383
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:17,902
在村里長大的童年故事
about growing up in the boondocks.

384
00:14:18,210 --> 00:14:20,510
雖然那私釀酒害我失明了一會兒 但是
The wine made me go blind for a bit, but...

385
00:14:20,510 --> 00:14:24,030
我永遠不會忘記她的聲音
...I'll never forget her voice,

386
00:14:24,030 --> 00:14:25,050
在黑暗中低喃
slurring in the darkness,

387
00:14:25,050 --> 00:14:28,130
告訴我她懂為什么米奇爾愛我
telling me she understood why Mitchell loved me.

388
00:14:28,590 --> 00:14:30,790
我記得第一次送海莉
I remember dropping Haley off at school

389
00:14:30,790 --> 00:14:31,790
去上學的時候
for the first time.

390
00:14:32,590 --> 00:14:34,530
她大大的眼睛凝視著我
Her staring at me with those giant eyes,

391
00:14:35,830 --> 00:14:39,290
嘴唇顫抖著 哭喊著讓我留下
her lips quivering, crying for me to stay.

392
00:14:39,290 --> 00:14:41,290
而我
And I, uh...

393
00:14:42,649 --> 00:14:44,302
我告訴她一切都會好的
I told her everything is gonna be all right,

394
00:14:44,302 --> 00:14:46,602
然后我跌跌撞撞地走向自己的車 開始流眼淚
and then I stagger back to my car and I start crying.

395
00:14:46,690 --> 00:14:46,810
我的天
Oh, gosh.

396
00:14:47,130 --> 00:14:48,750
你知道誰在那等我嗎
And you know who was there waiting for me?

397
00:14:50,635 --> 00:14:51,522
要是不是迪迪的話
Well, if it's not Dede,

398
00:14:51,522 --> 00:14:53,872
這就是個感人但沒什么意義的故事了
it's kind of a touching but pointless story.

399
00:14:53,872 --> 00:14:55,058
是迪迪
It was Dede.

400
00:14:55,490 --> 00:14:57,670
她知道那天我會很不好受
She knew it was gonna be a hard day for me.

401
00:14:58,450 --> 00:14:59,890
我不敢相信她走了
I can't believe she's gone.

402
00:15:01,230 --> 00:15:02,730
我會想她的
I'm gonna miss her.

403
00:15:03,750 --> 00:15:04,290
我也是
Me too.

404
00:15:05,902 --> 00:15:07,754
-敬迪迪 -敬迪迪
- To Dede. - To Dede.

405
00:15:20,410 --> 00:15:23,870
你想談 那我們就來談
Okay, you want to talk? Let's talk.

406
00:15:24,330 --> 00:15:27,190
我知道你從來沒喜歡過我
I know that you never liked me.

407
00:15:27,190 --> 00:15:29,210
而我一直都很友好
And I was always nice.

408
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:31,030
好吧 有一次
Okay, fine, one time,

409
00:15:31,030 --> 00:15:33,610
我確實給斯黛拉用了你的牙刷
I did use your toothbrush on Stella.

410
00:15:33,995 --> 00:15:36,683
但是大部分時候 我都欽佩你
But mostly I admired you for raising

411
00:15:36,683 --> 00:15:40,269
養育出這么優秀的子女 并且讓杰
such wonderful children and for helping make Jay

412
00:15:40,269 --> 00:15:43,585
成為了一個我深愛的好男人
the amazing man that I fell in love with.

413
00:15:43,694 --> 00:15:47,269
我想我從未因此向你表達過感激
I guess I never thanked you for all of that.

414
00:15:47,350 --> 00:15:49,850
所以 如果你現在能聽到我
So, if you can hear me now,

415
00:15:50,730 --> 00:15:51,990
謝謝你
thank you.

416
00:15:53,350 --> 00:15:56,090
另外能麻煩你也告訴羅莎·加西亞
And can you please tell Rosa Garcia

417
00:15:56,090 --> 00:15:58,290
別來纏著我了嗎
to stop haunting me, too?

418
00:15:59,290 --> 00:16:01,030
還有瑪爾塔·布蘭科
And Marta Blanco,

419
00:16:01,450 --> 00:16:04,710
瑪莉索·古鐵雷斯和塞西莉亞·馬托斯
Marisol Gutierrez, and Cecilia Matos?

420
00:16:04,710 --> 00:16:05,250
謝謝
Gracias.

421
00:16:08,810 --> 00:16:10,230
聽著 我很抱歉
Look, I'm sorry.

422
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:12,790
我好像一直想把媽媽說成是壞人
I think I've been trying to make Mom into the bad guy.

423
00:16:12,970 --> 00:16:14,310
但這并不能緩解她去世帶來的悲痛
It's not gonna make it any easier.

424
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:17,830
不是這樣的 我覺得很內疚
That's not it. I... I just feel so guilty.

425
00:16:18,250 --> 00:16:18,650
為什么
Why?

426
00:16:21,070 --> 00:16:22,030
因為有的時候
Because sometimes,

427
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:24,770
我對媽媽很刻薄 就像她對我一樣
I was as mean to Mom as she was to me.

428
00:16:25,848 --> 00:16:26,864
她對你那么嚴格
She was just hard on you

429
00:16:26,864 --> 00:16:29,234
都是因為她太相信你能成才了
because sh-she believed in you so much.

430
00:16:29,234 --> 00:16:31,346
你為什么總是維護她
Why do you always have to defend her?

431
00:16:31,730 --> 00:16:34,010
因為我以前愛她 我
Because I loved her! I...

432
00:16:35,359 --> 00:16:36,882
真不敢相信我已經開始用過去式來說她了
I can't believe I'm saying that in the past tense.

433
00:16:36,882 --> 00:16:40,687
我 我很抱歉我和她的關系更好
I -- I'm sorry that I had a better relationship with her.

434
00:16:40,687 --> 00:16:43,156
如果這讓你不爽了 我很抱歉
And I'm -- I'm sorry that it bothered you, okay?

435
00:16:43,156 --> 00:16:44,640
你和爸爸關系更好
You have a better relationship with Dad,

436
00:16:44,710 --> 00:16:47,070
但我知道他也像愛你一樣愛我
and I know he loves me just as much.

437
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:51,150
當爸爸去世的時候
Yeah, and when Dad dies,

438
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:54,090
他會帶著我對他深沉的愛離去
he's gonna leave knowing how much I loved him.

439
00:16:54,370 --> 00:16:56,210
我不確定媽媽知道我愛她
I'm not sure Mom knew that.

440
00:16:56,370 --> 00:16:57,490
她當然知道
Of course she did.

441
00:16:58,390 --> 00:16:58,870
真的嗎
Really?

442
00:16:59,070 --> 00:17:01,030
因為不像你 我上次和她聊天的時候
Because unlike you, the last time I talked to her,

443
00:17:01,030 --> 00:17:03,030
我們倆大吵一架
we got in a huge fight.

444
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:08,990
你能記住你告訴她你愛她 還有歡聲笑語
You get to remember telling her you loved her and laughing,

445
00:17:08,990 --> 00:17:11,810
而我只能記住我們因為一個臉書帖子
and I get to remember getting in some stupid argument

446
00:17:11,810 --> 00:17:13,110
胡吵一通
about a Facebook post.

447
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:15,581
她說把桉樹油抹在腳底板上
The one where she said putting eucalyptus oils

448
00:17:15,581 --> 00:17:17,812
能自然避孕的那個嗎
on the soles of your feet is a natural birth control?

449
00:17:17,812 --> 00:17:19,136
沒錯 是的
Yes. Yes.

450
00:17:19,136 --> 00:17:21,248
就是那個 而且你有個
That's the one. And you have

451
00:17:21,248 --> 00:17:23,000
12歲的女兒會讀那些帖子
a 12-year-old daughter who reads those posts --

452
00:17:23,230 --> 00:17:24,870
你最好告訴她那不科學
you might want to tell her that's not science.

453
00:17:24,990 --> 00:17:27,770
好了 記得我和媽媽最后那場
Okay, okay, remember that last amazing conversation

454
00:17:27,770 --> 00:17:28,930
-超歡愉的談話嗎 -你可饒了我吧
- I had with Mom? - Oh, for God's sakes.

455
00:17:28,930 --> 00:17:30,930
對不起 但是沒有別的方式表達了
I'm sorry, but there's no other way to describe it, okay?

456
00:17:31,206 --> 00:17:33,247
她給我講了你們吵架的事 她還
She told me about your fight, and she --

457
00:17:33,247 --> 00:17:34,562
她告訴了我自己有多難過
she told me how upset she was.

458
00:17:34,562 --> 00:17:37,619
她 她說她會給你打電話道歉
She -- She said she was gonna call you to apologize.

459
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:39,290
天啊
Oh, my God.

460
00:17:40,390 --> 00:17:42,910
前幾天她給我語音信箱留了言
She left me a voicemail a couple days ago,

461
00:17:43,047 --> 00:17:44,520
我沒聽 我一直存著
but I was saving it till the next time

462
00:17:44,930 --> 00:17:46,210
等想在公司罵人時 改為罵她
I had to yell at somebody at work.

463
00:17:47,390 --> 00:17:47,830
好
Okay.

464
00:17:49,950 --> 00:17:51,710
親愛的 是老媽
Hey, honey. It's Mom.

465
00:17:52,230 --> 00:17:53,890
我就是想跟你道歉
I just want to apologize.

466
00:17:53,970 --> 00:17:55,990
我不應該對你情緒失控
I should not have lost my temper.

467
00:17:56,331 --> 00:17:59,169
鳳凰羽薩滿的避孕方式
Shaman Phoenix Feather's family-planning advice

468
00:17:59,169 --> 00:18:00,544
可能不是所有人都適用
may not be for everyone,

469
00:18:00,850 --> 00:18:02,670
而你也只是想保護自己女兒的安全
and you just want to keep your daughters safe.

470
00:18:02,670 --> 00:18:03,930
我能理解
I get it.

471
00:18:03,930 --> 00:18:05,590
我自己也有親生閨女
I have a daughter of my own,

472
00:18:05,590 --> 00:18:07,770
我懂女兒能對自己有多重要
and I know how much she means to me.

473
00:18:08,250 --> 00:18:11,130
總之 對不起了 我愛你 我也會永遠愛你
Anyway, I'm sorry. I love you, and I always will.

474
00:18:11,350 --> 00:18:12,710
我也愛你 老媽
I love you, too, Mom.

475
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:17,890
對了 我看到了你在社交媒體新發的照片
Also, I saw your new photo on social media.

476
00:18:18,590 --> 00:18:20,210
你是加入了什么抗議活動
Are you part of some protest

477
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:22,650
要不洗頭來表達抗議之類的嗎
where you're not allowed to wash your hair?

478
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:24,250
還是你只是想要...
Or are you just trying to be --

479
00:18:24,250 --> 00:18:26,930
接下來的我等之后聽吧
I'm gonna listen to that later.

480
00:18:28,706 --> 00:18:30,011
聽到她聲音感覺好怪啊
Weird hearing her voice.

481
00:18:30,690 --> 00:18:31,590
老爸
Oh, Daddy.

482
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:36,922
你已經知道了 但我還是想告訴你
You already know this, but I want to say it again.

483
00:18:36,922 --> 00:18:39,292
我們倆都超級愛你
We both love you so much.

484
00:18:39,292 --> 00:18:42,071
我知道我們之間有過好與不好的時光
Yeah. And I know we've -- we've had our ups and downs,

485
00:18:42,670 --> 00:18:44,730
但我一直很喜歡當你的兒子
but I've loved being your son.

486
00:18:45,875 --> 00:18:46,931
你們這樣...
Hmm. Are you...

487
00:18:47,846 --> 00:18:49,948
跟我說好話 是因為偷吃了我三明治嗎
buttering me up 'cause you ate my sandwich?

488
00:18:51,230 --> 00:18:52,510
你是有什么毛病啊
What is wrong with you?

489
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:55,110
真的 你這么揪著這三明治的事不放是干嘛
Seriously. What is this obsession with a sandwich?

490
00:18:55,410 --> 00:18:56,830
我辛苦排了隊
I waited in line!

491
00:18:57,170 --> 00:18:59,070
我想著要吃好幾個月了
I was thinking about it for months!

492
00:18:59,259 --> 00:19:00,693
你知道誰會懂我的糾結嗎
You know who would get this?

493
00:19:00,693 --> 00:19:03,919
迪迪 這女人懂得欣賞一個美味三明治
Dede. That woman appreciated a good sandwich.

494
00:19:03,919 --> 00:19:06,270
而她做的三明治天下第一好吃
And she made the best ones, you know,

495
00:19:06,270 --> 00:19:07,793
我們剛結婚那會兒
when we were first married.

496
00:19:07,793 --> 00:19:09,536
還住在谷區的那個小房子里
In that little house in the valley.

497
00:19:10,203 --> 00:19:11,468
那時候我們窮得叮當響
And we didn't have any money,

498
00:19:11,468 --> 00:19:13,340
但她會不辭千里
but she would go miles out of her way

499
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:15,481
跑去買有美味脆邊的吐司
to get the bread with the crunchy crust

500
00:19:15,481 --> 00:19:16,935
是一家法式烘焙店做的
from that French bakery.

501
00:19:16,935 --> 00:19:20,331
外表看起來堅硬 但內里柔軟溫柔
It was hard on the outside, soft and warm on the inside,

502
00:19:20,331 --> 00:19:23,737
她會說"這吐司像你一樣 杰"
and she'd say, "That's just like you, Jay."

503
00:19:26,290 --> 00:19:27,890
她當年對我很好
She was nice to me back then.

504
00:19:28,130 --> 00:19:28,530
是啊
Yeah.

505
00:19:30,658 --> 00:19:35,229
說來好笑 我不久前還開車經過那里
It's funny, i happened to drive past there a while ago.

506
00:19:36,670 --> 00:19:37,970
那家烘焙店已經不在了
That bakery's not there anymore.

507
00:19:39,073 --> 00:19:41,453
而我也因此難過了一周吧
And damn if I wasn't depressed for a week.

508
00:19:42,927 --> 00:19:44,342
我以前一直沒意識到
You know, I didn't realize...

509
00:19:46,821 --> 00:19:48,375
它對我的意義
...how much it meant to me

510
00:19:49,450 --> 00:19:51,004
直到失去了才領會到有多重要
till it was gone, you know?

511
00:19:51,780 --> 00:19:52,757
-知道 -懂
- Yeah. - Yeah.

512
00:19:56,719 --> 00:19:59,299
